# Secrets never enter the build context (BUG-174): any .env file at any depth, keys, certificates,
# dumps and local tooling state. Only .env.example (placeholders) is allowed.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
backups/
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
.claude
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
.git
docs
